d:["$","$L1b","campaign-slideshow",{"slides":[{"id":"slide-kala","art":{"desktop":{"tone":"maroon","src":"/homepage/campaign/kala.webp"},"mobile":{"tone":"maroon","src":"/homepage/campaign/kala.webp"}},"title":"Kala","body":"Kala is craft with nothing ranked above anything else — the loom, the brush and the chisel under one word. These are the pieces where the weaving leans hardest on the other three, and where a weaver has clearly been looking at something that was not cloth.","ctaLabel":"Discover","ctaHref":"/pages/kala"},{"id":"slide-awadh","art":{"desktop":{"tone":"green","src":"/homepage/campaign/charbagh.webp"},"mobile":{"tone":"green","src":"/homepage/campaign/charbagh.webp"}},"title":"Awadh","body":"A hundred and twenty miles upriver, ornament is done in thread rather than in metal, and a single spray is trusted to carry a whole width. These were commissioned after a week of looking at it, which is a hard thing to walk out of and then ask for more zari.","ctaLabel":"Discover","ctaHref":"/pages/awadh"}]}]
e:["$","$L3","closing-thought",{"children":["$","section",null,{"className":"section-pad-prose wrap-prose text-center ","style":{"backgroundColor":"var(--color-bg)","backgroundImage":"linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0), var(--color-bg))"},"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-h3 mb-5","children":"Cloth that keeps time"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-5","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-body text-ink-body","children":"A saree outlives the season it was bought for, and often the person who chose it. That is the argument for weaving slowly and for buying once — a cupboard in this country is a form of archive, and what goes into it should still be worth taking out in twenty years."}]]}],null]}]}]
